11:27.100 --> 11:28.200
- In fact...
- 实际上...

11:28.267 --> 11:30.567
I'm not even here.
我什至都不在这里。

11:30.633 --> 11:32.967
- Um...uh...
- 嗯...呃...

11:33.067 --> 11:35.900
And we're backing away,
and backing away,
而我们正在后退，
并后退，

11:35.967 --> 11:37.600
and backing away!
并后退！

11:37.667 --> 11:39.233
narrator: You see?
I told you.
旁白：你看到了吗？
我告诉你了。

11:39.300 --> 11:42.433
Things always get weird
in "The Tidal Zone."
事情总是变得奇怪
在《潮汐区》中。

11:47.100 --> 11:49.267
- Amazing!
- 惊人的！

11:49.333 --> 11:50.367
